Subject: Drop the unlicensed Ailerons display font from the console and Login V1 themes
Origin: DHI-internal (DHI build harness)
Description: Remove the two @import lines and the two stylesheets that load the Ailerons display font, so the console and Login V1 builds no longer reference it.
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/zitadel/zitadel 709968cdd4257d7377bb95f22c840ee39ba951c6
Adaptation: The hunks apply to the pinned tag unchanged. The two binary .otf files are removed by a separate build step (test -f, then rm), because a unified diff cannot delete them.
Verify: test tests/zitadel_test.go::TestAileronsFontRemoved
Forwarded: not-needed (DHI build environment license policy only)
Drop-When: never: the font has no license evidence in the pinned tree, so it stays removed until DHI reviews a licensed copy

The Ailerons font has no copyright or license field in its name table, the pinned tree has no license file for it, and the designer's page gives no redistribution terms. Both font-family declarations are unused by any template, Go code, or TypeScript code in the tree, so removing them changes no rendered element. Only the three font URLs stop resolving.

---
diff --git a/console/src/styles.scss b/console/src/styles.scss
index edab8ec..826cbfe 100644
--- a/console/src/styles.scss
+++ b/console/src/styles.scss
@@ -11,7 +11,6 @@
 @import 'codemirror/lib/codemirror.css';
 @import './component-themes';
 @import './styles/lato-font.scss';
-@import './styles/ailerons.scss';
 @import './styles/palette-helper.scss';
 @import './styles/palette.scss';
 
diff --git a/console/src/styles/ailerons.scss b/console/src/styles/ailerons.scss
deleted file mode 100644
index 8e110fd..0000000
--- a/console/src/styles/ailerons.scss
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,5 +0,0 @@
-@font-face {
-  font-family: ailerons;
-  font-display: auto;
-  src: url(../assets/ailerons.otf) format('opentype');
-}
diff --git a/internal/api/ui/login/static/resources/themes/scss/styles/typography/faces/ailerons_font_faces.scss b/internal/api/ui/login/static/resources/themes/scss/styles/typography/faces/ailerons_font_faces.scss
deleted file mode 100644
index 0d585db..0000000
--- a/internal/api/ui/login/static/resources/themes/scss/styles/typography/faces/ailerons_font_faces.scss
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,4 +0,0 @@
-@font-face {
-    font-family: Aileron;
-    src: url(../../../fonts/ailerons/ailerons.otf ) format('opentype');
-}
\ No newline at end of file
diff --git a/internal/api/ui/login/static/resources/themes/scss/styles/typography/typography.scss b/internal/api/ui/login/static/resources/themes/scss/styles/typography/typography.scss
index 526ea30..671a7a9 100644
--- a/internal/api/ui/login/static/resources/themes/scss/styles/typography/typography.scss
+++ b/internal/api/ui/login/static/resources/themes/scss/styles/typography/typography.scss
@@ -1,4 +1,3 @@
-@import 'faces/ailerons_font_faces';
 @import 'faces/lato_font_faces';
 @import 'faces/roboto_font_faces';
 @import 'faces/raleway_font_faces';
